 "_design": "Overlord jab 2, rebuilt from zero (ANIM-JAB-1, 2026-11-11) from the owner's idea of 2026-11-08 and his reference video: a forehand slap with the right hand, fingers spread and hooked (villain claw; fire or lightning later), on a planted lunge. f0 is jab 1's hold pose (the cancel leaves from there). Windup f6: the trunk turns right, the claw rises beside the head. The slap lands on the first active frame f9 (active f9-11) with the body low and forward, then the hand only drifts toward the face while the head drops to look at it (f20, held). FAF f26. After the FAF the hand trembles with power (f27-37) and closes, idle at f52. The left forearm stays folded on the belly until the way back.",
 "_tremor": "NOT in the base poses: key it at build time on hand_r_fk_ctrl only (Rotation, about +-4 deg decaying to +-0.5, one key per frame f27-f37) on the additive 'Manuale' section of LS_OverlordJab2V2_Build, so the body keeps its sparse keys (owner keyframe rule).",
